    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malagho gha Daudi gha kutua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agha nigho malagho gha kutua gha Daudi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Masikari gha Daudi agho gherekoghe ghikumikie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agha nigho marina gha masikari gha Daudi agho gherekumikieghe: Joshebu-bashebethi ufumie Takemoni; orekoghe m'baa wa awo wabaa wadadu welusha wuda. Uo oretumieghe ifumu jake kubwagha wandu maghana wunyanya andenyi ya wuda ghumweri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo wa kawi wa awo wabaa wadadu ni Eleazari mwana wa Dodo wa kinyumba cha Ahohi. Orekwanyeghe na Daudi ingelo werewizarumagha Wafilisti awo werekwanyikieghe kwa wuda ima Waisraeli wikakuwunjagha nyuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orewukieghe na kuwikaba Wafilisti hata mkonu ghwake ghukasilwa, ukamaziria lufu lwake, na BWANA ukabonya wusimi m'baa ituku ijo; wandu weechawuya tu kurua wafu maswagha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo wa kadadu wa awo wabaa wadadu ni Shama mwana wa Agee, ufumie Harari. Wafilisti werekoghe wakwanyika chiaimweri aja Lehi, andu korekoghe na mbuwa ichue miwalwa ya dengu, na wandu wikawikimbia Wafilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Shama ukamanga gi ghadi na ghadi ya ija mbuwa; ukailindia na kuwibwagha Wafilisti; BWANA ukampatira wusimi m'baa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaavui na ngelo ya makuwido, wandu wadadu wa awo mirongo idadu wereserieghe kwa Daudi iji orekaieghe mbangenyi aja Adulamu, na bonjo ya Wafilisti werekoghe wabonya kambi vololonyi ya Refaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iyo Daudi odeeka ukikuvisa, na ngome ya Wafilisti edeeka aja Bethlehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ukakaia na bea ya machi ukaghamba, “Oe ngai ado! Ngera loli mndungi wadanipatira machi ghenywa ghafuma kiriwa cha Bethlehemu chiko kaavui na mbenge!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao mang'oni adadu wikakufungisha ndighi kuida aghadi ya kambi ya Wafilisti, wikadaya machi kiriwenyi cha Bethlehemu, chiko kaavui na mbenge, wikamredia Daudi. Ela Daudi ukalegha kughinywa, na wulalo ghwaro ukaghifunya kizongona kwa BWANA kwa kughidia andonyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukaghamba, “Ilagho jenywa agha machi jikaie kula nani putu ee BWANA kwa kukaia ni karakara na kunywa bagha ra wandu wawika marangi ghawo ndengonyi kuendaghionda.” Niko Daudi ukalegha kughinywa. Malagho agho gherebonyeroghe ni agho mang'oni adadu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai mruna Joabu mwana wa Seruia, orekoghe m'baa wa vilongozi mirongo idadu. Ukawusa ifumu jake na kuwibwagha wandu maghana adadu; ukakupatira irina aghadi ya awo mirongo idadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orekoghe mundu ukumikie aghadi ya awo mirongo idadu, ukawuya m'baa wawo; ela nderevikieghe wuing'oni ghwa waja wambao wadadu anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Benaia mwana wa Jehoiada orekoghe ing'oni ja Kabseeli, m'bonyi wa maza mbaa. Orebwaghieghe mang'oni awi gha Moabu. Wokoni orengirieghe kinenyi chiko na shimba andenyi; ukaibwagha ngelo theluji ereserieghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena ukam'bwagha Mmisri umu ughokie uko na ndighi, orekoghe na ifumu mkonunyi kwake, ela Benaia ukamseria na mzata; ukamsoka ifumu jake na kum'bwagha uja Mmisri na ifumu jake jeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agha nigho malagho gherebonyeroghe ni Benaia mwana wa Jehoiada, ukakupatira irina aghadi ya ghaja mang'oni mirongo idadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orekumikieghe loli loli aghadi ya waja wandu mirongo idadu ela nderevikieghe wuing'oni ghwa waja wandu wadadu anduangi. Na Daudi ukammbika ukaie m'baa wa walindiri wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaheli mruna Joabu orekoghe umu wa waja mang'oni mirongo idadu, na Elhanani mwana wa Dodo kufuma Bethlehemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shama na Elika wifumie Harodi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helezi ufumie Peleti; Ira mwana wa Ikeshi ufumie Tekoa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiezeri ufumie Anathothi, Mebunai, Mhushathi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salmoni, Muahohi, Maharai ufumie Netofa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helebu mwana wa Baana ufumie Netofa, Itai mwana wa Ribai ufumie Gibea ya Wabenjamini; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaia ufumie Pirathoni, Hidai ufumie meda ya machi gha Gashi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abialboni, Muarbathi, Azmawethi ufumie Bahurimu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliaba ufumie Shaalboni, wana wa Jasheni, Jonathani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shama, Mharari, Ahiamu mwana wa Sharari, Mharari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elifeleti mwana wa Ahasbai ufumie Maaka, Eliamu mwana wa Ahithofeli ufumie Gilo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezro ufumie Karmeli, Paarai Muarbi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igali mwana wa Nathani ufumie Soba, Bani, Mgadi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zeleki, Muamoni, Naharai ufumie Beerothi uo oremdukiagha maswagha Joabu mwana wa Seruia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ira, Muithri, Garebu, Muithri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uria Mhiti; wose ni wandu mang'oni mirongo idadu na mfungade.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
